{"ticker":"JCI","updated":"2026-11-13T00:30:17Z","profile":{"longName":"Johnson Controls International plc","shortName":"Johnson Controls International ","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Building Products & Equipment","country":"Ireland","website":"https://www.johnsoncontrols.com","fullTimeEmployees":null,"marketCap":86348447744,"trailingPE":30.201273,"forwardPE":19.23404,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.3643124,"pegRatio":1.62,"targetMeanPrice":174.14285,"targetHighPrice":201.0,"targetLowPrice":136.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.104,"earningsGrowth":-0.401,"grossMargins":0.37072,"operatingMargins":0.15604,"profitMargins":0.11116,"totalRevenue":25666000896,"beta":1.289,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":160.41,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":108.41,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.11},"summary":"Johnson Controls International plc, together with its subsidiaries, engages in engineering, manufacturing, commissioning, and retrofitting building products and systems in the Americas, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and the Asia-Pacific. The company designs, manufactures, sells, installs, and services heating, ventilating, air conditioning, controls, building management, refrigeration, integrated electronic security, integrated fire detection and suppression systems, and digital solutions. It also provides energy solutions and technical services, including inspection, scheduled maintenance, and repair and replacement of mechanical and control systems, as well as data-driven building solutions. It sells its products and services to commercial, residential security, institutional, industrial, data center, marine, and governmental customers. Johnson Controls International plc was incorporated in 1885 and is based in Cork, Ireland.","summary_zh":"江森自控國際有限公司及其子公司在美洲、歐洲、中東、非洲和亞太地區從事建築產品和系統的工程、製造、調試和改造。該公司設計、製造、銷售、安裝和服務供暖、通風、空調、控制、建築管理、製冷、整合式電子安全、整合式火災偵測和滅火系統以及數位解決方案。它還提供能源解決方案和技術服務，包括機械和控制系統的檢查、定期維護、維修和更換，以及數據驅動的建築解決方案。該公司